    "data": {
      "id": 2335,
      "hub_id": null,
      "guid": "net.drexira.weightsandraidtimes",
      "name": "Dragon Den - Weights and Raid Times",
      "slug": "dragon-den-weights-and-raid-times",
      "teaser": "A simple mod that allows you to change Weight of items (can use complex means) and change Raid Time per map.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/PwvpVKZIhQnHJFs6PTcoNTUCj6bfUyifSidF1dVk.png",
      "downloads": 552,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>What it does</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Change raid time per map</li>\n<li>Change item weight with global, per parent, or per item rules</li>\n<li>Optional whitelist and blacklist to target specific items</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Raid Time</strong><br />\nSet minutes per map.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Weight Changer</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Global percent applies to all items when no other match</li>\n<li>Per parent percent by item parent id or parent name</li>\n<li>Per item percent by exact item id or name</li>\n<li>Whitelist limits edits to listed items</li>\n<li>Blacklist excludes specific items and overrides all</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Rule priority</strong><br />\nPer item over per parent<br />\nPer parent over global<br />\nBlacklist over everything</p>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Unpack the zip and drop the user folder into your SPTarkov root.</p>\n<p>(Use 7Zip <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Here</a>)</p>\n<p>Install demo video credit to Drakia:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"Demonstration\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How to Use</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Edit the config file in <code>DragonDen-WeightsAndRaidTimer\\config</code> The config contains comments.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Toggle features on or off</li>\n<li>Set minutes per map for raid length</li>\n<li>Set weight percents</li>\n<li>Add parent ids or names for category edits</li>\n<li>Add specific item ids or names for overrides</li>\n<li>Use the whitelist to restrict edits only to listed items</li>\n<li>Use the blacklist to protect items from any change</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Compatibility</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Can be used with SVM but should be loaded after it, and not using the same settings.</li>\n<li>Has to be loaded after all mods that add items or change raid settings.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Adjusting Raid Times too large can cause issues.</li>\n<li>Other than that, none that I know of.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><strong>Drakia</strong> for the install video</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-8\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is Dragon Den</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Dragon Den</strong> is my twist on Tarkov. It is where cuteness, edgyness, and weirdness collide while staying believable.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Traders with their own quirks and attitude</li>\n<li>Custom items and quests that feel fresh</li>\n<li>Backpacks, armor, facewear and headwear with personality</li>\n<li>Odd creations that should not exist but still fit right in</li>\n</ul>\n<p>No weapons, just everything else that makes Tarkov less boring.</p>\n<p>Want to reach me? Look for #drexiras-dragon-den in <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/WelcomeToTarkov\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Welcome To Tarkov’s Discord</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
